egin="00:30.410" end="00:30.560">it's </span><span begin="00:30.560" end="00:30.860">hurting </span><span begin="00:30.860" end="00:31.040">me </span><span begin="00:31.040" end="00:31.370">deep </span><span begin="00:31.370" end="00:31.760">inside</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.760" end="00:34.370"><span begin="00:31.760" end="00:32.086">Cause </span><span begin="00:32.086" end="00:32.412">I </span><span begin="00:32.412" end="00:32.738">been </span><span begin="00:32.738" end="00:33.064">dreaming </span><span begin="00:33.064" end="00:33.390">about </span><span begin="00:33.390" end="00:33.716">you</span><span begin="00:33.716" end="00:34.042">, </span><span begin="00:34.042" end="00:34.370">oooh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.960" end="00:39.380"><span begin="00:35.960" end="00:36.200">I've </span><span begin="00:36.200" end="00:36.290">been </span><span begin="00:36.290" end="00:36.560">wishing </span><span begin="00:36.560" end="00:37.040">that </span><span begin="00:37.040" end="00:37.310">I </span><span begin="00:37.310" end="00:37.580">was </span><span begin="00:37.580" end="00:37.820">next </span><span begin="00:37.820" end="00:38.060">to </span><span begin="00:38.060" end="00:38.480">you</span><span begin="00:38.480" end="00:38.810">, </span><span begin="00:38.810" end="00:39.380">oooh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.010" end="00:42.410"><span begin="00:40.010" end="00:40.190">I've </span><span begin="00:40.190" end="00:40.310">been </span><span begin="00:40.310" end="00:40.610">dreaming </span><span begin="00:40.610" end="00:40.880">of </span><span begin="00:40.880" end="00:41.600">us</span><span begin="00:41.600" end="00:41.750">, </span><span begin="00:41.750" end="00:42.410">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.030" end="00:47.810"><span begin="00:44.030" end="00:44.180">I've </span><span begin="00:44.180" end="00:44.270">been </span><span begin="00:44.270" end="00:44.570">thinking </span><span begin="00:44.570" end=